From a77aa7c0bba94aa7463c3282ec017c039fd0d11c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 06:05:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD terminal visual copy selection for both panes

Terminal command mode tracks rendered text selections independently for the left and right panes, supports character, line, and block ranges, and copies the resulting text through OSC52 so users can copy transcript or agent-list content without leaving the UI.
